{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate the secrets of a shadowy government archive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faceless officials demand files on conspiracies, disappearances, and scandals. You must search the shelves, deliver the documents, and decide: release them to the public, or destroy them forever. Every choice shifts the news feed, the voices of the people, and the fragile Trust Slider that measures faith in the government. Some truths will calm the masses. Others will spark suspicion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069870/extras/6f82538e5d0c20375ed6ca615b0244b8.poster.avif?t=1761064837\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069870/extras/6f82538e5d0c20375ed6ca615b0244b8.webm?t=1761064837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069870/extras/6f82538e5d0c20375ed6ca615b0244b8.mp4?t=1761064837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search the Archive</strong> \u2013 Dig through shelves of classified files filled with conspiracies, scandals, and cover-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide the Fate</strong> \u2013 Release documents to the public or shred them forever. Every choice matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic News Feed</strong> \u2013 Watch headlines and public comments react instantly to your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust Slider</strong> \u2013 Manage the fragile balance of faith in the government. Keep it above 90% to win, but fall below 10% and the system collapses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Stability, chaos, or something in between \u2014 your path shapes the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong> \u2013 Cover-ups will come back to haunt you in unexpected ways. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal Interface, Maximum Tension</strong> \u2013 A desk, a computer, a slot in the wall\u2026 and the weight of a nation\u2019s trust in your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069870/extras/f45bf227f50440e6d075c010d3f9bb67.poster.avif?t=1761064837\" width=600 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069870/extras/f45bf227f50440e6d075c010d3f9bb67.webm?t=1761064837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you protect stability at any cost\u2026 or let the truth bleed through the cracks?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069870?t=1761064837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069870/30fd7c3425ff5ec78c3f6602cfe7067e37e3030b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761064837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069870/812f38c567f82d5075b649b14ed27187cb8f8156/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761064837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069870/812f38c567f82d5075b649b14ed27187cb8f8156/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761064837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate the secrets of a shadowy government archive.